Because of **Torment and Consume Shadows**:

- **Torment** provides reliable, low-cost **threat generation**, crucial for solo play to keep mobs focused on the voidwalker (not the warlock).
- **Consume Shadows** allows **out-of-combat health regen** while the pet is active, enabling safer, more efficient leveling without frequent downtime or bandages.

Succubus offers damage and utility (Seduction, invisibility), but **survival and consistent threat** from the voidwalker make it the default for steady questing/leveling. [end of text]


